    "description": "## Objective\n\nBlock duplicate Players and duplicate Referrers by email while allowing one email to exist once per record type, and auto-link the Player and Referrer profiles of the same person.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n* Before-save flow populating Email_Record_Type_Unique__c (RecordType.DeveloperName + email) on Player and Referrer\n* Matching and duplicate rules scoped per record type across Primary/E-Transfer/Secondary email\n* After-save flow maintaining Related_Referrer_Profile\\__c / Related_Player_Profile_\\_c cross-links\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n* A second Player with an existing Player email is blocked\n* A Referrer sharing an email with a Player saves successfully\n* Cross-links populate automatically when both profiles exist\n\n## Testing Notes\n\nDuplicate-scenario suite per design doc story D-03.\n\n---\n\nEstimate: L · \\~24h · Dependencies: POC-08 · Ticket BUILD-03 (approved 2026-07-04)",
